### Get a clients para obetener respuesta basica
GET http://localhost:3000/api/client

### Post para crear un nuevo cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/client
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Elon Musk",
    "email": "elonluna123@gmail.com",
    "company": "SpaceX"
}

### Put para actualizar un cliente existente
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/client/a5f6234e-058b-4a7d-81aa-d7cf9c67e2d3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "company": "Tesla"
}

### Delete para eliminar un cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/client/a5f6234e-058b-4a7d-81aa-d7cf9c67e2d3